# Triple-quoted string as doc: value in function annotation
# Verifies that """...""" (desugared to unindent(...)) is accepted by the doc: handler
[
  add: [fn@[doc: """
    Adds two numbers.
    Returns their sum.
    """ return: Int] [let x@Int y@Int] [+ x y]]
  result: [add 2 3]
]

---

%.result
=== out
Int(5)
